    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0320",
      "reading_order": 354,
      "section": "3.3.5.2 Pneumatic System Operation with NIBP simulator",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 147.75,
        "t": 402.75375,
        "r": 539.0626500000001,
        "b": 362.99625
      },
      "content": "These  tests  verify  the  functionality  of  the  N5500  pneumatic  system.  The  Bio-Tek simulator or any equivalent NIBP simulator is required to perform these tests. Each of the tests must be performed to verify pneumatic system functionality.",
      "section_id": "sec_3_3_5_2",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_3_3_5",
      "section_level": 4,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_7",
          "title": "7. Test #4: Print-on-alarm"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_3_3_5",
          "title": "3.3.5 Measurement Parameter Operation Tests"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_3_3_5_2",
          "title": "3.3.5.2 Pneumatic System Operation with NIBP simulator"
        }
      ],
      "page": 25,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0321",
      "reading_order": 355,
      "section": "3.3.5.2 Pneumatic System Operation with NIBP simulator",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 147.75,
        "t": 349.31625,
        "r": 539.0624000000001,
        "b": 322.49625
      },
      "content": "The N5500 must be placed in NIBP Test Mode . For a detailed explanation of the NIBP Test Mode, refer to Service Menu and Factory Default Settings section .",
      "section_id": "sec_3_3_5_2",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_3_3_5",
      "section_level": 4,
